{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Set the subscribed processes"},"description":"Replaces the list of subscribed processes. Without an active subscription the result has status 402 and a Stripe Checkout destination for a person to open. With one, an addition through this tool also answers status 402 with the Plan page as destination: nothing is charged here, only the page charges, after a person confirms it. Removals apply at once and the removed processes stay readable until the end of the paid period. An empty list is refused (empty_selection): use cancel_creator_plan. Contract 0.3.1. Needs an organisation token (Authorization: Bearer hodds_...); without it the tool returns the error token_required.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"processes":{"items":{"description":"Process id of /catalogue/processes.json.","enum":["automate-workflows","build-ai-agents","use-ai-models","develop-software","host-and-deploy","store-and-query-data","analyze-data","secure-access","monitor-systems","collect-web-data","do-accounting","invoice-and-get-paid","accept-online-payments","business-banking","manage-expenses","run-payroll","manage-people","recruit-talent","sign-documents","start-a-company","run-a-practice","manage-customer-relationships","find-leads","run-email-marketing","manage-social-media","build-websites","sell-online","support-customers","design-visuals","produce-media","improve-search-visibility","manage-projects","write-and-document","communicate-as-a-team","schedule-appointments","store-and-share-files","process-documents","transcribe-and-translate","collect-forms-and-surveys","improve-ai-discoverability","agentic-cybersecurity"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":60,"type":"array"}},"required":["processes"],"type":"object"},"name":"set_creator_processes","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"payment_required":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"added":{"items":{"description"